        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "17.2.5 The University shall determine and supply any safety-related equipment necessary to do the work safely and to avoid injury or accidents. Unit members agree to use such equipment properly and as directed by the University to prevent injury and accidents.",
            "block_bbox": [
